                        <li><strong>Artificial Satellites:</strong> Used to calculate the necessary velocity for satellites to stay in orbit.</li>
                        <li><strong>Free Fall:</strong> Explains why objects accelerate towards the Earth at $9.8 \, \text{m/s}^2$ (ignoring air resistance).</li>
